# ~/.stow-global-ignore — deployed by the `stow` package of this repo.
#
# Stow only reads ignore lists from two places: `.stow-local-ignore` at the top
# level of an individual package, or this file in $HOME. A `.stow-local-ignore`
# placed in the stow directory itself (e.g. Srcs/) is silently ignored.
#
# WARNING: defining this file REPLACES stow's built-in default ignore list,
# so the useful defaults are reproduced below.
#
# Patterns are anchored Perl regexes matched against each path segment
# (the basename), unless the pattern contains a "/", in which case it matches
# the path relative to the package root.

# --- Secrets: never symlink these into $HOME ---
.*\.key
.*\.pem
.*\.token
.*\.gpg
.*_rsa
.*_dsa
.*_ecdsa
.*_ed25519
\.env
\.envrc
\.netrc

# --- Editor and temporary noise ---
.*\.swp
.*\.swo
.*~
.*\.bak
\#.*\#
\.DS_Store

# --- VCS (reproduced from stow's built-in defaults) ---
\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules
\.hg
\.svn
_darcs
CVS
\.cvsignore
RCS
.+,v
\.\#.+

# --- Repo-level files that should never land in $HOME ---
^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING
